  <metadata>
    <name>Alhambra, Dehesa del Generalife y río Genil</name>
    <desc>Circular walk from Plaza Nueva up through the Alhambra woods, along the Acequia Real path across the Dehesa del Generalife, down past the badlands to Lancha del Genil and back to Granada along the Genil river. Rebuilt for Runline from public paths in OpenStreetMap.</desc>
    <author><name>Runline contributors</name></author>
    <copyright author="OpenStreetMap contributors"><year>2026</year><license>https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/</license></copyright>
    <link href="https://github.com/adrianetti/runline/tree/main/routes"><text>Runline open routes</text></link>
    <keywords>hiking, Granada, Alhambra, Dehesa del Generalife, Acequia Real, Genil</keywords>
  </metadata>
